BAR domain-containing sorting nexins SNX5, SNX6 and SNX32; can self-associate to form homodimers (PubMed:23085988, PubMed:39073202). The heterodimers are proposed to self-assemble into helical arrays on the membrane to stabilize and expand local membrane curvature underlying endosomal tubule formation. Thought to be a component of the originally described retromer complex (also called SNX-BAR retromer) which is a pentamer containing the heterotrimeric retromer cargo-selective complex (CSC), also described as vacuolar protein sorting subcomplex (VPS), and a heterodimeric membrane-deforming subcomplex formed between SNX1 or SNX2 and SNX5 or SNX6 (also called SNX-BAR subcomplex); the respective CSC and SNX-BAR subcomplexes associate with low affinity (Probable). Interacts with SNX5, SNX6, SNX32, VPS26A, VPS29, VPS35, FNBP1, KALRN, RHOG (GDP-bound form) (PubMed:11438682, PubMed:14596906, PubMed:17101778, PubMed:19619496, PubMed:19935774, PubMed:20604901, PubMed:23085988, PubMed:39073202)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"O60749-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":402,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000514949.1"],"refseq":["NM_001278199.1"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001265128.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,118,402]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":117,"original":"MAAEREPPPLGDGKPTDFEDLEDGEDLFTSTVSTLESSPS","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":117,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[0,1,0],[1,1,0],[2,1,0],[3,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O60749-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O60749-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":87.2,"plddt":[[0,17],[50,4],[70,2],[90,12],[70,7],[90,48],[70,4],[50,15],[70,8],[90,30],[70,6],[50,8],[0,2],[50,12],[0,4],[50,4],[70,3],[90,131],[70,1],[90,2],[70,4],[90,72],[70,1],[90,2],[70,3]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000205302.8"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":1,"gencode":15,"mapped":2},"explo